,"type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"pipes and sockets. Alternatively, a channel can be created for a","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"file in a system independent manner using [ctor"},{"code":"GLib.IOChannel.new_file","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"].","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Once a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GIOChannel"},{"type":"text","text":" has been created, it can be used in a generic"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"manner with the functions [method"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GLib.IOChannel.read_chars"},{"text":"],","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"[method"},{"code":"GLib.IOChannel.write_chars","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"], [method"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GLib.IOChannel.seek_position"},{"text":"],","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and [method"},{"code":"GLib.IOChannel.shutdown","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"].","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"To add a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GIOChannel"},{"text":" to the main event loop, use [func","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GLib.io_add_watch"},{"text":"] or","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"[func"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GLib.io_add_watch_full"},{"type":"text","text":"]. Here you specify which events you are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"interested in on the "},{"code":"GIOChannel","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and provide a function to be called","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whenever these events occur."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GIOChannel"},{"text":" instances are created with an initial reference count of 1.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"[method","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"G